B. CAPS: how informative is the market's deviation from the rating line in Week 1?  err_elo_line ~ (mkt - elo_line)
   err_elo_line = margin + elo_line (+ = home beat the rating line); dev = mkt - elo_line (+ = market likes home LESS than ratings).
   So a fully-earned market deviation gives slope -1. Reported 'info share' = -slope: 1 = fully informative (do not cap), 0 = noise.
